==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|liggje}}
* {{nn-inf|ligg}} 

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|liggja|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nn}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*ligjaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|nn}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}.

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-irreg|ligg|låg|lege}}

# [[lie]] (to be in a horizontal position.)
#: ''Kvifor '''ligg''' du her?''
#:: Why are you '''lying''' here?
# [[lie]] (location), be [[located]]
#: ''Kvar '''ligg''' kjøpesenteret?''
#:: Where is the shopping centre '''located'''?

